   "titulo": "How much?",
   "texto": [
    "**Wie viel** goes with what is not counted: **Wie viel Reis?** (how much rice?). **Wie viele** goes with what is counted, in plural: **Wie viele Eier?** (how many eggs?).",
    "**Viel** = a lot. **Wenig** = little. **Nicht viel** = not much.",
    "The measurements also do not put «of»: **ein Kilo Tomaten**, **ein Liter Milch**."
